    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="68">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 68</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And uton don, swa us ðearf is, helpan æfre ðam raðost ðe helpes beholoð; [þonne nime we þæs lean þær us leofast byð].</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And let us, as our duty is, ever render help with the utmost speed to those who require help; [then shall we receive the reward for so doing where we most desire it].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ utan don, swa us þearf is, helpan áá þam raþost, þe helpes betst behofað; þonne nime we þæs lean, þær us leofast byð.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
